", "color": "024e91", "default": false, "description": "Airflow Helm Chart", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "state": "open", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/milestones/131", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/airflow/milestone/131", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/milestones/131/labels", "id": 14625168, "node_id": "MI_kwDOAgUK284A3ymQ", "number": 131, "title": "Airflow Helm Chart 2.0.0", "description": "", "creator": {"login": "jscheffl", "id": 95105677, "node_id": "U_kgDOBasyjQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95105677?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/jscheffl", "html_url": "https://github.com/jscheffl", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jscheffl/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jscheffl/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jscheffl/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jscheffl/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jscheffl/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jscheffl/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jscheffl/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jscheffl/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jscheffl/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "open_issues": 7, "closed_issues": 27, "state": "open", "created_at": "2026-01-25T12:28:27Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-16T21:55:58Z", "due_on": null, "closed_at": null}, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2026-09-11T23:59:15Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-19T23:23:54Z", "closed_at": null, "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/73016", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73016", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73016.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73016.patch", "merged_at": null}, "body": "The `checksum/*` pod annotations hash the entire rendered ConfigMap or Secret, and the manifest's `metadata.labels` include `helm.sh/chart`. That value changes on every chart version bump, so every Airflow component is restarted on `helm upgrade` even when no configuration has changed.\r\n\r\nThis adds an `airflow.configMapOrSecretContentHash` helper that hashes only the `data`/`stringData` sections, and uses it for all 37 `checksum/*` annotations across the api-server, scheduler, dag-processor, triggerer, worker, flower, statsd, otel-collector and pgbouncer templates.\r\n\r\nRendering the chart at 2.0.0 against a bumped version with identical values is now byte-identical, while changing `config.core.parallelism` still moves `checksum/airflow-config`. The full helm test suite passes (2155 tests).\r\n\r\nThe same fix was recently made in the argo-cd chart (argoproj/argo-helm#4044); the loki chart uses the same data-only hashing.\r\n\r\nUnrelated, but found while testing: `checksum/jwt-secret` is unstable on every render, and even differs between two pods in the same render, because `chart/templates/secrets/jwt-secret.yaml` defaults to `randAlphaNum 128` and each `include` re-evaluates it. With `jwtSecret` unset those pods restart on every upgrade regardless of this change. Happy to open a separate issue or PR for that.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\r\n\r\n- [X] Yes \u2014 Claude Opus 5 (Claude Code)\r\n\r\nGenerated-by: Claude Opus 5 (Claude Code) following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73016/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73016/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}], "search_type": "lexical"}}